  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">D&#xE9;tachement au sein de l&apos;entit&#xE9; Culture et situations d&apos;urgence CLT/CE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under the overall authority of the Director of Culture and Emergencies and direct supervision of the Chief of Unit for Movable Heritage and Museums, the incumbent shall : Support ratification and implementation of 1970 Convention, notably by sharing good practices through travel and/or meetings ; Follow-up on strategic initiatives in Africa implemented by CEM/MHM ; Act as focal point for English-speaking African countries by drafting various working documents and following activities in the region, in liaison with UNESCO Field Offices; Contribute to the development of partnerships and assist in any other task necessary for the smooth functioning of the Unit&apos;s work.</narrative>
  </description>
